        "text": "=You are a data transformation engine. You will receive a JSON ARRAY as input.\nTransform EACH object into a Zoho CRM Lead–ready object and return ALL results as ONE JSON ARRAY.\nTRANSFORMATION RULES:\n- id: original id\n- full_name: original name \n- first_name: first word of name\n- last_name: last word of name \n- email: original email\n- phone: original phone \n- city: address.city\n- Company: company.name (STRING ONLY) \n- website: original website \n- lead_source: \"AI Automation\" INPUT DATA: {{ JSON.stringify($input.all().map(i => i.json)) }} CRITICAL RULES: \n- company MUST be a STRING, not an object.\n- Process ALL items. \n- Do NOT skip any item.\n- Return ONLY a valid JSON ARRAY.",
